WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
This was Yitro, Cohen Midian, Hotein Moshe. Later, immediately Cohen Midian drops out of the picture.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
But he still is Yitro. And then Yitro and Hotein. And then even Yitro disappears, his own personality is already totally submerged.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
He is only Hotein Moshe. You see the whole change in the development of character.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.560
Now comes the...

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:30.960
Maybe would you like to sit down here?

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.160
Maybe I...

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.080
Can we...

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.400
Somebody could lend them a book

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.060
because somebody could read together.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:40.000
All right.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.140
Now, what we're going to read now,

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:49.080
it is undoubtedly the most important event

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:51.840
in the history of the Jewish people,

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.120
in the history of mankind.

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:55.740
As you can see,

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
He does not understand this portion. He really doesn't know his Jewish roots.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.000
And we're going to go into the very basis of Judaism.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.000
When you're going to ask, for instance, a Jew, why you have to put the filim?

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Why you have to... you cannot eat pork? Why you have to be in Shabbat?

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.000
The ultimate answer is not whatever rationalism that you're going... rationalization you're going to give him.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.000
The ultimate reason is...

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:30.400
We made, not even God said so, we made an agreement with God, a covenant with the Lord.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.400
And here comes to describe this covenant.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:37.200
Amen.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:44.200
And the third month, which is the month of Sivan.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:50.200
They said, Bnei Yisrael Melech Yisrael, the third month means upon leaving Egypt,

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:53.140
In that very day,

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:56.080
means as the moon come out,

00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:58.120
a new moon,

00:01:58.780 --> 00:01:59.140
you see?

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.020
In that very day,

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:03.740
as the moon was coming out,

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:08.360
at that very moment,

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:10.580
they came to the desert

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:12.900
where the mountain of Sinai is there.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.420
49 days.

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:16.960
How much?

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:18.760
49 days.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:20.120
I mean, the beginning of the third month.

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:21.900
Yeah, all right, so two months have passed.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:23.700
No, no, no.

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:26.000
The first of the third month.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.120
No, no, no.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:28.700
They left at 15.

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:29.620
They left at 15.

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:30.320
15.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:32.580
15 of December.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.600
So, that's right, they left at 15.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.280
What did you say?

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:40.080
That is to say three months after the third month.

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:40.700
The third month.

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:41.320
At the beginning.

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:42.660
Two months after then.

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:43.380
45 days.

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:44.980
Whatever it is, at the beginning of the third month.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:45.460
45 days.

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:46.720
You know, we're wasting time here.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:53.960
The details will be covered.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:54.920
Amen.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:57.960
By Yom Hazeh,

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.440
in that very day,

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:02.280
as the moon,

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:04.200
the new moon was coming,

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.360
Ba'umit Varsinay.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.180
Vash'ume Refidim.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:10.520
How they came to Varsinay?

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:13.120
First they left Refidim,

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:14.100
the place where they had

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:15.460
the battle with Amalek.

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:19.260
And then from

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:20.200
up on leaving

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.580
they came to the desert of Sinai

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:25.100
and they

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.600
encamped not in the mountain

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.500
but in the actual desert.

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:31.100
Amen.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.860
And there Israel encamped

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:36.420
where?

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:38.420
Right around

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:39.880
the mountain.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:42.540
Amen.

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:51.240
Moses goes up to God

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:55.220
And when he goes up to God

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:57.060
Means up to the mountain

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:58.340
Where God the Shekhinah is there

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:01.600
Only after going up

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:05.740
God calls up on Moshe

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:08.040
And he charges him with a mission

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.620
Moshe now is going to be

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:12.080
The ambassador of God

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:14.140
the Sharia of God

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:16.380
to Israel.

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:19.840
Kortoman lebed Yaakov

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:21.540
I'm going to make a proposal.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.360
The proposal is the covenant.

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:27.060
Speak first to the house of Jacob.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.440
The Midrash says that the house of Jacob

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.000
is the woman.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:30.900
That is the Midrash.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:33.020
The truth is that the bed Yaakov

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:34.260
always means to the leadership.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:35.740
The house of Jacob.

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:37.500
You see?

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.140
Speak up first to the leaders.

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:44.900
to the Jewish leaders you speak

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:46.540
to the Lebanese

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:50.440
it means you explain

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:52.220
you go into details

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.000
the leaders you don't need the details

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:54.980
because they are more intelligent

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:57.220
but to the common people

00:04:57.220 --> 00:05:02.040
now he says

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:07.440
you have experienced yourself

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:12.940
what I did to Egypt. Therefore you know my power.

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:16.880
You know who am I. Not through books. Through your own experience.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:20.880
And you know that I not only have

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:22.320
power to destroy

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:26.940
but I also have power to bestow good.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:29.740
To take care of you.

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:36.320
As I took you upon the wings of eagles.

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:41.500
In other words, I took you like if you would have wings of eagle and brought you up here,

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:43.200
without any kind of problems.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:45.600
In other words, from here you could see from your own experience,

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:53.860
not only I am cruel with my enemies, I'm also compassionate with my people.

00:05:55.720 --> 00:06:04.640
And I bring you to me, to the place where I dwell, the mountain of Sinai.

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:08.120
Dehatta, accordingly.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:10.700
Since you had your own experience about this,

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:11.920
you could best judge it.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.940
I want to make a proposal to you.

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:17.100
In general terms, it's the following.

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:20.260
Im shamot ishmea ube kolim.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:21.000
That's the proposal.

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:21.740
You don't have to.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.900
But if you agree to listen to my voice,

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.700
what does it mean to listen to my voice?

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:33.740
Ush martemet beriti means that you're going to keep the covenant.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:34.960
You're going to make a covenant.

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.000
the commandment

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:36.740
613

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:37.180
means what

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:38.400
not just to

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:38.860
listen to the

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:39.280
voice of God

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:39.720
in abstract

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:40.340
but the

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:41.540
actual 613

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:41.980
commandments

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.780
and then

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:45.940
if you do

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:46.520
this

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:46.980
this is

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:47.580
what you

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:48.060
take upon

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:48.360
you

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:49.080
then I'm

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:49.160
going to

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:49.380
tell you

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:49.880
what I'm

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:50.120
going to

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:50.460
take upon

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:50.740
me

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:53.260
you're

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:53.460
going to

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:54.020
be chosen

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:55.400
like a

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:55.740
treasure

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:56.680
a treasure

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:57.120
a chosen

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:57.600
treasure

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.420
from among

00:06:59.420 --> 00:06:59.920
all the

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:00.240
nations

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:00.560
I'm going

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:00.920
to choose

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:01.040
you

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:01.560
if you're

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:01.760
going to

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:02.320
choose me

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:03.960
I reciprocate

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:04.280
by to

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:04.800
choose you

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:07.520
Kili kola a'ar

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:09.000
because I have the earth

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.160
what does it mean I have the whole world

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:11.220
the whole world belongs to me

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:15.100
this is a choice

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.380
not out of necessity

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:18.940
but out of love

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:20.680
I don't need you

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:22.280
and you don't need me

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:24.100
there's many people in the world without God

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:26.080
you could exist without me

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.760
and I could exist without you

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:30.340
but if you decide

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:31.400
to make a covenant

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.620
then this is the agreement

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:38.620
The whole world comes to me, I don't need you, and you don't need me.

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:44.620
It's not out of force, it's not out of necessity, it's an act of love.

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:48.620
And that's why we say everyday in the Shema,

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:51.620
Baruch Atah Hashem, Ahavat Olam, it's a love,

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:56.620
Baruch Atah Hashem, HaBohar Be'amo Yisrael, Be'ahava

00:07:56.620 --> 00:08:01.620
He chose God, Israel as an act of love. Does He need us? No.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:05.920
No. Also, we don't need them in the sense that how many people are without God?

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:08.000
We are the only people with God.

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:13.060
It's an act of love. We do it out of this. Alright?

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:14.920
Now,

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:21.040
what's going to be the outcome of this?

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:25.400
We observe the Torah. Why?

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:29.840
To have God's aid, to have Allah's help, to have wealth?

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:30.960
No.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:35.300
So you're going to be for me

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:37.560
a nation of priests.

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.960
Every Jew is going to be

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:41.060
the priest of God.

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:44.080
In other words, we don't have

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.220
no intermediaries between us and God.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:47.920
Every Jew has

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.340
direct access to God.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:52.860
They're all kadosh.

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:55.020
And you're going to be a separate nation.

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:56.720
This is the outcome.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:58.660
I'm not going to be powerful.

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:00.500
This is secondary for power.

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.060
This is not the part of the covenant.

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:04.260
The covenant is a very simple thing.

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:07.200
Yitamli mamlechet kohanim,

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.700
a kingdom of priests.

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:11.560
What does it mean a priest?

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:14.480
A priest works all the life of a priest

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:15.740
is devoted to one thing,

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:16.880
to his own sanctuary.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:18.980
The only thing,

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:23.260
the priest is a professional religious person.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:24.820
Every Jew is going to be like this.

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:27.360
What does it mean?

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:29.260
Just like a priest among the goyim,

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.260
He only cares about this. Same thing

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:33.520
every one of us should care about

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:34.040
Al-Torah.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.400
Keeper of the faith. We are the

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:38.720
keepers of the faith. You see?

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:40.580
Mamleche kohanim

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.440
veroikados. In a nation

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:45.340
which is holy, sacred.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:47.320
It's not like among the

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:49.360
goyim, the priest is priest and the other people, they go

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:51.100
like, we see the new years of the goyim.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:53.300
The priest go to the

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:54.920
mass and the goyim, they go and they

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:57.380
white like animals. Like they drank

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:58.940
animal. You know? Like beast.

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:00.080
This is not us.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:00.620
Alright?

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:05.320
These are the things

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:07.820
that you want to propose

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:09.320
at Bnei Israel.

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:11.900
So Moshe goes up to the mountain

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:13.240
and God says,

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:15.060
I have a deal for you.

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:16.960
My deal is,

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:18.020
I want to make a covenant.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:19.960
The terms of the covenant is very simple.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:22.320
You choose me, I choose you,

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:24.700
I take care of you,

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:26.360
and you take care of my besot.

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:28.960
Outcome, not power,

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:29.440
and Hades,

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:33.580
this is the outcome.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:35.280
You want it?

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:37.280
Vayabo Moshe.

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:40.720
Moshe came down

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:41.380
from the mountain.

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:43.360
Vayikra,

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:45.460
says,

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:47.260
what do you mean?

00:10:47.260 --> 00:10:47.300
What do you mean?

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:49.320
The leaders.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:51.120
Christ speaks to the elders.

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:55.360
He presents.

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.580
Nobody is posing, nobody.

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:00.960
...

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.960
...

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:04.300
Are you interested?

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:05.040
It's your choice.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.360
And obviously after this,

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.000
it was to the people.

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:12.580
...

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:14.680
And all the people,

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.640
first is the Zikni Aam and then the people.

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:16.920
Yes?

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:20.800
That was probably what happened.

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:21.920
He presented to the Zikni,

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:23.420
the Zikni presented this to the people.

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:25.040
And then there was an assembly.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:26.580
...

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:32.700
all of what God proposed

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:36.160
we shall do

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:39.700
we are interested in the deal

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:42.020
so

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:43.940
now Moshe Rabbeinu

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:45.140
goes back to

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.340
it's a pure business

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:47.340
he goes and goes

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:48.620
to diplomatic protocol

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:49.760
Moshe Rabbeinu

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:51.880
remits the message

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:52.920
to Borei Olam

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:58.360
Not

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:01.320
Because this is ultimately

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.740
A decision by the people

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:05.520
It's taken out of freedom

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:08.120
Nobody is imposing his will upon nobody else

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:09.620
What do you mean

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:10.580
Moshe go to the house?

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:12.060
I have to be with God

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:15.720
Very common

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:17.320
Bring back the answer

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:22.200
Excuse me

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:25.580
God is telling Moshe Rabbeinu

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:27.840
I have a deal for the Jewish people

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:29.800
Go and tell

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:32.420
Present this to the Jewish people

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:33.360
To see whether they are interested

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:35.760
He presented this to the Jewish people

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:36.440
They are interested

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:37.400
Now he is going to remain

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:40.300
I did your messenger

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:41.940
Your mission

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.280
And this is the result of the mission

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:44.860
He is reporting now to God

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:48.940
But why in Pasuk 3

00:12:48.940 --> 00:12:50.380
Moshe Awa

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:51.540
Elohim

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:54.440
Oh, the first time?

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:55.920
Probably

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:58.660
you know, inspired by God.

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:00.480
Yeah, I don't know.

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:02.360
I don't know. Probably one day. I don't know.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:04.580
Maybe one day I have to study and instead of studying

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:06.100
God says I have a proposal for you.

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:08.820
Now,

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:12.340
at this point,

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:14.140
what was the proposal?

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:15.300
He didn't give him details.

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:18.480
If you listen to what

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.500
I'm going to tell you.

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:22.040
No, no, I'm going to make a deal.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.140
Wait, wait.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:28.020
First in general, are you interested in the deal?

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:29.180
Yes.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.080
Now we're going to see what happens.

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:41.640
Now God says, alright, I am ready to make the deal.

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:43.060
Amen.

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:43.120
Amen.

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:51.580
I'm going to come to you

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:52.740
not to the people

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.320
to you Mr. Moshe

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:55.060
individually

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:59.840
and I'm going to appear

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:01.300
and wait

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.080
explanation will be forthcoming

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:08.080
inside

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:10.080
the thickness of the cloud

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:15.540
now why I'm going to appear

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.140
why I'm going to appear

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:19.560
and speak to you from the thickness of the cloud

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:25.860
so that the people will hear

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.020
that I'm speaking to you

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:27.660
in other words

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:33.620
Moshe Rabbeinu is the messenger of God

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:36.320
how do we know that Moshe Rabbeinu is the messenger of God

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:37.160
maybe he's lying

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:40.120
So God is going to come

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:41.500
And speak to Moshe Rabbeinu

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.600
And appoint him as his Shaliyah

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:45.800
In front of everybody

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:48.480
Why?

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:49.840
I want to see why

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:55.160
So that people will hear me

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.280
Speaking to you

00:14:56.280 --> 00:15:01.120
And so they are going to believe in you

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:01.740
Forever

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:04.340
Now we know that Moshe Rabbeinu is Shaliyah Adonai

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:04.940
How do you know?

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:06.580
Because we heard him

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:11.380
we heard God speaking to him when they say for instance Yeshua went to Shammai

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:16.460
did you see him? no they say miss Zona she was a there was a some Zona by the name of

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:22.600
Magdalena she saw him flying all the religion is belief about this Zona all of a sudden

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:28.900
some nut no she was a professional prostitute that professional prostitute

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:33.580
saw him the whole religion and what she said she saw him going up to heaven

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:42.360
say no we know that because we heard God speaking to Michelle up and we

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:46.020
experienced three million people

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:52.220
what is it you know children

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:53.860
Over 21.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:02.040
Now, one second.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:03.080
I think, William,

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:07.600
all right, let them rest in peace.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:11.720
No, but we are digressing

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:13.340
and we said the most important parasha

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:14.780
and we should really pay attention to it

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.640
because it is the most important parasha we have.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:21.560
Now, why in the thickness of the cloud?

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:25.060
Because God never reveals himself in body.

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:26.840
When God reveals himself,

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.180
he's in darkness.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:30.280
You cannot see God.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:32.840
God is not going to appear like in the movies.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:33.640
I know this.

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:35.360
The Ab Hianan.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:35.880
Alright?

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:40.340
And then,

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:42.500
God, Moshe Rabbeinu,

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:45.200
reported to God

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:47.000
the answer of the people.

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:48.120
He's already done that.

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:49.400
No, he didn't do that.

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:51.380
He would have to do it.

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:56.260
First Vayash he returned to do it, but before he was able to do it, God spoke to him.

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:58.960
Vayash and Moshe.

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:03.920
No, means he returned to say it.

00:17:04.260 --> 00:17:05.400
Vayash means to return.

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:06.460
He didn't say it.

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:07.440
Now Vayaget.

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:11.100
I'm sorry, if you pay attention here.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:13.420
It says Vayaget, now he delivers.

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:15.300
So before Moshe.

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:16.000
He went back.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:18.840
Before Moshe told Hashem.

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:22.660
He went back to the mountain in order to return, but he didn't speak it.

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:25.540
Before he spoke it, G-d told him this.

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:25.760
Exactly.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:26.840
Interesting.

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:29.000
He says, I'm going to appoint you.

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:29.800
You see?

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:34.040
And then it was formally presented the position of the people.

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:40.380
Now, I'm appointing you, go back to the people.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:45.580
And let them be purified themselves.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:49.360
In other words, separate themselves from their wives.

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:52.920
Hayom u'mahar.

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:55.680
V'chibessus emnotam.

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:56.980
And let them wash their clothing.

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:00.420
V'hayom nechonim.

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:02.520
And let them prepare themselves, in other words,

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:06.300
to be separated from anything that may include their own wives.

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:07.900
La'yom ha'shedishi.

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.000
And be ready for the third day.

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:12.420
Ki v'ayom ha'shedishi,

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:15.320
which is going to be exactly the 50th day

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:16.620
that's the Shabuot

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:21.980
God is going to appear

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:26.020
and so everybody is going to be able to witness

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:28.180
Al-Harsinayat

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:28.780
so in other words

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:30.700
we're going to see what happens

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:32.520
out of this witnessing

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:36.240
now God is going to appear

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:38.940
and

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:41.660
the Hakamim say something beautiful

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:46.900
Otherwise, if you... I need to insert what I am saying because otherwise the next few

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:51.540
pesukim are going to be a little bit vague.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:58.660
When God, the Torah says that when God appeared in Harsinayim, every Jew, everybody died.

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:00.660
Parha nishmatan.

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.660
Parha nishmatan, they died.

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:08.660
Then came the malakhim, the Torah, the people, they died.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:12.040
He says, he's sweet in his words.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.380
He's soft in his words.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:17.000
Very briefly.

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:22.160
Rabbi Shem Tov ben Shem Tov, a great hacham sefaradim, says like this.

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:29.420
He says, God appears as he is.

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:36.280
When God appears as he is, we cannot take it.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:37.920
We all die.

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:42.660
It's simple. It's too much.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:46.660
There are certain things which are beyond the comprehension of us, of people.

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:52.660
Our knowledge, our psychology, our emotions are limited.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:56.660
Imagine a cockroach in front of a human being.

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:58.660
How much could a cockroach understand?

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:02.660
Very limited in emotion, in understanding, in sophistication.

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:05.420
the difference between God and us

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:07.100
is much

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:09.440
infinitely much bigger than the difference

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:10.800
between a cockroach and a human being

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:13.540
it transcends

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:15.500
our mind so when God appears as he

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:15.800
is

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:18.400
we no longer exist

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:20.600
we are like melted in front of him

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:23.520
that's the secret

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:24.620
of what says the hachamim says

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:27.080
he softens his words

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:30.660
he allows

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:33.540
to be perceived

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:36.180
subjectively by each one

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:37.440
according to his own capacities.

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:39.800
Listen about this.

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:41.860
If there is a square,

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:43.800
we all go to watch

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:46.020
to perceive the square in the same way.

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:50.500
The miracle within the miracle

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.320
is that

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:53.380
when God appears,

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:55.980
each one could perceive God

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.080
according to his own

00:20:58.080 --> 00:20:58.720
category.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:01.480
Do you understand what I mean?

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:02.820
It's incredible.

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:04.900
It's a miracle within a miracle.

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:06.480
Let me repeat it.

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:09.220
Two and two is four.

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:11.560
It's going to be perceived equally by everybody.

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.780
Borei Olam, which is the supreme truth,

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.640
is much more true than two and two is four.

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:20.100
Could be perceived differently

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:22.800
according to each one's capacity.

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:24.860
All right?

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.620
This is what says,

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:28.960
Veher Balta.

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:32.780
you should put a boundary to the people

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:35.860
in other words

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:39.420
it means a boundary at two levels

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:41.660
first geographically

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:43.760
don't let them come very close to the Harsinai

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:47.480
some people are going to be closer and are going to be farther from Harsinai

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:50.480
but also it means psychologically you must know

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:52.880
that the people have a limit

00:21:52.880 --> 00:21:56.600
and each one let them

00:21:56.600 --> 00:21:58.560
to try to see that he's going to perceive God

00:21:58.560 --> 00:22:00.440
only according to the limits of their own

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:02.360
intelligence. So therefore,

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:04.420
if I perceive God in one way

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:06.000
and Aharon perceives it differently,

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:08.200
I should not say, no, Aharon is lying. No.

00:22:08.600 --> 00:22:10.540
Aharon is greater than I am, and therefore

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:11.960
he perceives it greater.

00:22:12.300 --> 00:22:14.460
We are smaller, and the

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:16.500
other person is bigger. Each one

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:17.060
so they go,

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:20.320
let them know that

00:22:20.320 --> 00:22:22.240
each one has a limitation.

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:24.540
And there are limitations within limitations.

00:22:25.680 --> 00:22:26.100
You understand?

00:22:26.600 --> 00:22:28.360
There's the Quranim, there's the Levim,

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:30.320
then there is the Israelim, and each one

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:32.380
is within that category of the Arameans.

00:22:33.300 --> 00:22:33.760
Again,

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:36.180
I want you to reflect,

00:22:36.320 --> 00:22:38.600
not now, later on, on your own free time,

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:40.420
upon the miracle

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:42.540
within the miracle. The supreme truth

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:44.300
reveals itself.

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:46.220
First, as the Haraim say,

00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:48.180
it reveals itself in its pure truth.

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:50.440
Ah, everybody

00:22:50.440 --> 00:22:50.820
dies.

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:53.100
It's like a mashal.

00:22:53.700 --> 00:22:56.040
So then, it says, this truth has to be

00:22:56.040 --> 00:23:02.700
appear in different facets. Two and two is four, it's different for each one. Am I

00:23:02.700 --> 00:23:07.320
clear? Could you grasp it? That's, that's, you know,

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:12.780
Alright? You see? Alright?

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:18.560
around the, around the mountains, and these two, two

00:23:18.560 --> 00:23:21.180
dimensional meanings.

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:23.900
Be careful.

00:23:25.900 --> 00:23:28.560
Is God? Oh, I'm going to go and shake hands with God.

00:23:28.680 --> 00:23:29.020
No, no.

00:23:30.440 --> 00:23:32.860
God appears to us, doesn't mean to

00:23:32.860 --> 00:23:35.360
have overconfidence

00:23:35.360 --> 00:23:36.900
and no more respect.

00:23:37.220 --> 00:23:38.220
Oh, God is already here.

00:23:38.360 --> 00:23:40.820
Like the Goim say, we eat with God

00:23:40.820 --> 00:23:41.820
and all this stuff.

00:23:41.820 --> 00:23:42.460
No.

00:23:43.840 --> 00:23:44.100
You see?

00:23:45.260 --> 00:23:47.280
Who don't touch even

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:49.440
a part of the mountain.

00:23:51.800 --> 00:23:55.020
Not you, man.

00:23:55.120 --> 00:23:55.500
You will die.

00:23:56.180 --> 00:23:58.620
Why? Because

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:01.160
if we are trying to understand something

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:02.180
which is beyond

00:24:02.180 --> 00:24:05.160
our capacity, we lose

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:06.480
our entity as a human being.

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:09.260
We dissolve. It's like a moth

00:24:09.260 --> 00:24:10.940
next to the light.

00:24:12.780 --> 00:24:15.580
It will be absorbed and burned by the light.

00:24:17.280 --> 00:24:19.600
I think one said this, Mashallah.

00:24:19.940 --> 00:24:20.120
Right.

00:24:20.760 --> 00:24:21.960
It's not a physical death.

00:24:22.840 --> 00:24:24.160
It's a physical death.

00:24:24.420 --> 00:24:25.880
The person would physically die.

00:24:26.180 --> 00:24:27.320
His heart would stop.

00:24:27.980 --> 00:24:29.160
Actually, his heart would stop.

00:24:30.240 --> 00:24:31.340
In other words, and this is true.

00:24:31.380 --> 00:24:32.740
From fear or from understanding.

00:24:33.180 --> 00:24:33.400
Right.

00:24:33.740 --> 00:24:34.280
Makes no difference.

00:24:35.340 --> 00:24:37.320
Let me tell you something, Mr. Ashkenazi.

00:24:37.320 --> 00:24:42.740
If a person with his mind will go beyond his comprehension,

00:24:42.740 --> 00:24:46.540
there's no longer difference between fear, understanding, panic,

00:24:47.060 --> 00:24:49.320
the man would lose the sense of reality.

00:24:51.180 --> 00:24:55.240
When it comes to a certain limit of the fantasy,

00:24:55.500 --> 00:24:58.580
which is no longer possible for the person to distinguish already,

00:24:58.960 --> 00:24:59.780
between right and wrong,

00:25:01.380 --> 00:25:03.840
he loses the sense of reality.

00:25:05.020 --> 00:25:06.340
That's an intellectual gut.

00:25:07.800 --> 00:25:09.740
But anyhow, the guy, his heart...

00:25:09.740 --> 00:25:10.180
Insane.

00:25:10.180 --> 00:25:11.640
No, no.

00:25:11.640 --> 00:25:14.980
No, his heart actually would stop beating.

00:25:15.400 --> 00:25:15.980
And this is true.

00:25:16.280 --> 00:25:19.520
From a shock, a person could have a shock,

00:25:19.820 --> 00:25:21.220
and he dies from a shock.

00:25:21.680 --> 00:25:22.400
A great shock.

00:25:23.600 --> 00:25:25.760
And there is nothing greater shock than...

00:25:25.760 --> 00:25:26.660
Completely overwhelmed.

00:25:27.080 --> 00:25:27.300
You know?

00:25:27.860 --> 00:25:29.640
For example, if somebody...

00:25:30.240 --> 00:25:32.320
No hand should touch that mountain.

00:25:33.320 --> 00:25:34.660
Even if you don't walk there,

00:25:34.880 --> 00:25:37.320
your hand is going to pass by it.

00:25:38.160 --> 00:25:39.220
Ki sakoli saket.

00:25:39.720 --> 00:25:41.120
If somebody is going to touch it,

00:25:41.120 --> 00:25:43.680
stones, you know, it's going to be

00:25:43.680 --> 00:25:44.280
in his skull.

00:25:46.280 --> 00:25:47.160
He's going to be

00:25:47.160 --> 00:25:49.520
thrown by other things. He's going to be like shaken

00:25:49.520 --> 00:25:51.340
out there, like it would be an electric shock

00:25:51.340 --> 00:25:53.060
and would be, you know, pushing

00:25:53.060 --> 00:25:54.660
him out of the mountain.

00:25:55.880 --> 00:25:57.480
In Rahim is, whether he's a

00:25:57.480 --> 00:25:59.080
human being or a beast.

00:25:59.900 --> 00:26:01.360
Right here, he will die

